          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "acr/bug",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "applyDiscount returns negative zero for a zero total"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "bug",
                  "agent"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "acr/bug",
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "applyDiscount returns negative zero for a zero total\n\n`Math.sign(total) * Math.round(discounted)` returns `-0` when `total` is `-0` (or any negative total whose discounted magnitude rounds to 0, e.g. `applyDiscount(-0, 10)`): `Number.isSafeInteger(-0)` is true, `Math.abs(-0)` is `0`, and `Math.sign(-0)` is `-0`, so `-0 * 0 === -0`. The documented contract says the result is an integer amount in the smallest currency unit, and `-0` is observable to callers that use `Object.is`/`assert.strictEqual` or `1 / result === -Infinity`, and it will not compare equal to `0` under those checks. Fix by normalising the sign, e.g. `const magnitude = Math.round(Math.abs(total) * (1 - discountPercent / 100)); return total < 0 ? -magnitude : magnitude;` (which also yields `0` rather than `-0`). No test in test/pricing.test.js covers a zero or `-0` total, so this is currently unguarded."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/pricing.js"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 30
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "severity": "low",
            "confidence": 0.85,
            "status": "validated",
            "source": "agent",
            "reviewRunId": "d779fd44-1179-44c5-b6c3-5e06268e5060"
          }
        }
      ],
      "originalUriBaseIds": {
        "REPO_ROOT": {
          "uri": "https://github.com/KamerrEzz/argus-sample/tree/ebfde15a6fce8efff3bbf4b691385a9082d4dd9b/"
        }
      },
      "columnKind": "utf16CodeUnits"
    }
  ]
}